{{!
    @template mod_scormmakercmi5/session_ended

    Shown instead of the player when its session is over: the player page was reloaded, the unit was launched
    again from another window or tab, or the session ended. Rendered by player.php and by the
    mod_scormmakercmi5/player module, which then moves the focus to the heading.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * viewurl - URL of the activity page.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "viewurl": "https://example.com/mod/scormmakercmi5/view.php?id=5"
    }
}}
<div class="mod-scormmakercmi5-session-ended" data-region="mod_scormmakercmi5-session-ended">
    <h3 tabindex="-1">{{#str}} sessionended, mod_scormmakercmi5 {{/str}}</h3>
    <p>{{#str}} sessionended_detail, mod_scormmakercmi5 {{/str}}</p>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{viewurl}}">{{#str}} backtoactivity, mod_scormmakercmi5 {{/str}}</a>
</div>
